      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS ARIZONA (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (23.11) at this track over 400m. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from five starts. Well-placed to take this out. QUICK THINKIN' (2) produced a moderate effort last time when sixth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Ice On Fire (17.97) in a Grade 3/4. Placed at his previous run. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BOY NAMED BLUE (6) is better than last start when fourth (25.61) from Box 4 at Maitland over 450m. Should be about the money. BLAZING PRINCE (8) can sneak into the finish.",
